IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mt-tanf`

-- Montana TANF cash assistance -- the applicant's seat (the caretaker relative applying for the family, or a needy
-- pregnant woman). Plain inputs; each question calls the core in mt-tanf.l4. BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as
-- advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `Montana TANF cash assistance -- the applicant's questions`

§§ `Who counts`

@export Is this child a "dependent child" for Montana cash assistance (53-4-201(5))?
GIVEN `the child's age` IS A NUMBER @desc The child's age in whole years
      `the child is a student` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether the child is a student as the department's rules define (this matters only at age 18)
      `the child lives with a caretaker relative` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether the child lives with a parent or other relative, within the degree of kinship the department's rules set, who looks after the child
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is this child a dependent child` IF
    `is a dependent child` `the child's age` `the child is a student` `the child lives with a caretaker relative`

§§ `Can we get cash assistance`

@export Can my family be granted Montana TANF cash assistance, or is it barred (53-4-231)?
GIVEN `we have a dependent child, or I am pregnant with no other children` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether a dependent child lives with you, or you are a needy pregnant woman with no other children
      `months until my baby is due` IS A NUMBER @desc Only if you are pregnant with no other children: how many months from now the baby is expected (0 otherwise)
      `I signed an individual responsibility plan if asked` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you entered into an individual responsibility plan, if the department required one (yes if not required)
      `we cooperate with screening and assessment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you and the other adults in the household take part in any screening and assessment the department requires
      `I assigned support rights and cooperate on child support` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you have assigned child support rights to the department and cooperate in establishing paternity and getting child support
      `months of TANF cash any adult here has received` IS A NUMBER @desc The total months any adult in the family has received TANF-funded cash assistance, in any state, consecutive or not
      `I receive SSI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you receive Supplemental Security Income
      `I am a non-citizen barred by federal law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you are not a US citizen and federal law (PRWORA ss 401-435) does not let you get this assistance
      `I am a fugitive felon or violating probation or parole` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you are fleeing prosecution or custody for a felony, or violating probation or parole
      `I was convicted of lying about my residence in the last 10 years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you were convicted, in the last 10 years, of fraudulently misrepresenting your place of residence to get assistance
      `I have a drug felony and am not complying or discharged` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you have a controlled-substance felony and are neither complying with your supervision nor finished with the sentence
      `I am a teenage parent not in school or not adult-supervised` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you are a teenage parent who is not attending school or training as required, or not living in an adult-supervised setting
      `I am away from the home too long` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether you are, or will be, away from the caretaker's home longer than the department's rules allow
GIVETH AN `Eligibility answer`
`Can my family be granted TANF cash assistance` MEANS
    `the eligibility under 53-4-231`
        (`Household facts` WITH
            `the family includes a dependent child, or I am a needy pregnant woman with no other children` IS `we have a dependent child, or I am pregnant with no other children`
            `months to the expected birth, if pregnant with no other children`                    IS `months until my baby is due`
            `the caretaker entered an individual responsibility plan if required`                 IS `I signed an individual responsibility plan if asked`
            `the caretaker and other adults cooperate in required screening and assessment`        IS `we cooperate with screening and assessment`
            `the caretaker assigned support rights and cooperates on paternity and child support` IS `I assigned support rights and cooperate on child support`
            `months of TANF-funded cash assistance any adult in the family has received, in any state` IS `months of TANF cash any adult here has received`)
        (`Person facts` WITH
            `receives SSI`                                                      IS `I receive SSI`
            `a non-citizen not eligible under PRWORA ss 401 to 435`             IS `I am a non-citizen barred by federal law`
            `a fugitive felon or probation or parole violator`                  IS `I am a fugitive felon or violating probation or parole`
            `convicted of fraudulently misrepresenting residence within the last 10 years` IS `I was convicted of lying about my residence in the last 10 years`
            `a drug felony and not complying with supervision or not discharged` IS `I have a drug felony and am not complying or discharged`
            `a teenage parent not attending school or training as required, or not in an adult-supervised setting` IS `I am a teenage parent not in school or not adult-supervised`
            `absent from the caretaker's home beyond the department's period`  IS `I am away from the home too long`)

-- This group only arises once the family is receiving cash assistance.
§§ `While we receive cash assistance (if you are receiving it)`

@export How much of this month's child support is passed through to us and not counted against the grant (53-4-260)?
GIVEN `current child support collected for us this month` IS A NUMBER @desc Current child support collected on your family's behalf this month, not counting arrears
GIVETH A NUMBER
`How much child support is passed through to us` MEANS
    `the support passed through and disregarded` `current child support collected for us this month`

@export May the department give us child-care assistance (53-4-611)?
GIVEN `we receive cash assistance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether your family receives TANF cash assistance
      `I need child care to work or for my plan activities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether child care is necessary for you (or both parents) to do paid work or the activities in your individual responsibility plan
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `May we get child-care assistance` IF
    `may get child-care assistance` `we receive cash assistance` `I need child care to work or for my plan activities`
